JUDGES NOTE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Challenge 3 requires a robust multi-source signal ingestion pipeline.
  CIRO ingests 4 signal types: user_gps, weather_api, traffic_api,
  social_mock. Only user_gps signals carry GPS coordinates. The previous
  non-nullable lat/lng columns meant 3 of 4 signal types would crash on
  insert. This fix enables the full multi-source ingestion that the
  challenge evaluates. The type column fix ensures the Detection Agent
  can correctly cluster signals by type when determining incident confidence.

